# This file deliberately excludes nothing.
#
# What gets published is decided by "builds" in vercel.json, which names
# exactly one file: web/index.html. Nothing else in this repository is
# deployed, whatever is sitting beside it.
#
# An earlier version of this file said:
#
#     *
#     !index.html
#     !vercel.json
#
# which was written when the page lived at the repository root. Once the page
# moved into web/, that pattern excluded the page itself: the build ran, found
# nothing to publish, and every URL answered 404 with no error in the log.
#
# Exclusions here cannot make the deployment safer than "builds" already
# makes it, and they can silently empty it. So there are none.
